lation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon during the last 24 months. Reiteration Physical Phenomenon in facilities of the same owner: Three faults have occurred in facilities of the same owner with a similar physical phenomenon (approved), during the last 24 mobile months, corresponding to the Studies for Failure Analysis of the following table: DATE FALLA ID NAME FALLA ACTIONS FALLA The company Transelec S.A. indicates the following corrective actions of short-term: \u201c","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 486/2025\n\u201cFalla en l\u00ednea 220 kV C\u00f3ndores - Parinacota\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 28-11-2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n general de la interrupci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 08/11/2025\nHora 13:48\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 42.17\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 10540.00\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.400 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea 220 kV C\u00f3ndores - Parinacota / LT167CI1TR01----T0002\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea de transmisi\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 220 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n Nacional\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada Transelec S.A.\nRUT 76.555.400-4\nRepresentante Legal Arturo Le Blanc Cerda\nDirecci\u00f3n Orinoco 90, piso 14, Las Condes\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento fallado L\u00ednea 220 kV C\u00f3ndores - Parinacota / LT167CI1TR01----T0002\nPropietario elemento fallado Transelec S.A.\nRUT 76.555.400-4\nRepresentante Legal Arturo Le Blanc\nDirecci\u00f3n Orinoco N\u00ba90, piso 14, Las Condes\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la desconexi\u00f3n forzada de la l\u00ednea 220 kV C\u00f3ndores - Parinacota, por operaci\u00f3n de las\nprotecciones de ambos extremos, ante la presencia de una falla monof\u00e1sica en la fase B.\nLa causa de la falla fue el acortamiento de distancia entre los conductores de la l\u00ednea y el cable de\nguardia, el cual se encontr\u00f3 cortado en el vano comprendido entre las estructuras N\u00b0319 y N\u00b0320.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico\nOPE10: Falla de material, por fatiga, corrosi\u00f3n, trizadura, etc.\nLa empresa Transelec S.A. remite antecedentes para acreditar el origen de la falla.\nd.3 Reiteraci\u00f3n\nReiteraci\u00f3n Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico en la instalaci\u00f3n afectada: Esta instalaci\u00f3n no ha sido afectada por el\nmismo fen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico durante los \u00faltimos 24 meses m\u00f3viles.\nReiteraci\u00f3n Fen\u00f3m","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":-0.04},{"w":"failure","s":-0.27},{"w":"analysis","s":0.03},{"w":"2025","s":0.07},{"w":"failure","s":-0.27},{"w":"kv","s":0.03},{"w":"date","s":0.1},{"w":"description","s":-0.06},{"w":"date","s":0.1},{"w":"time","s":0.09},{"w":"failure","s":-0.27},{"w":"date","s":0.1},{"w":"08","s":0.21},{"w":"11","s":0.31},{"w":"2025","s":0.07},{"w":"time","s":0.09},{"w":"13","s":-0.15},{"w":"mw","s":0.07},{"w":"17","s":-0.15},{"w":"prior","s":-0.03},{"w":"mw","s":0.07},{"w":"00","s":-0.3},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.03},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.03},{"w":"10","s":0.06}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"busbar_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.0323,"breaker_fault":0.064,"transformer_fault":0.1893,"busbar_fault":0.7144},"confidence":0.7144,"correct":false},"quorum":{"pred":"transformer_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.2555,"breaker_fault":0.1363,"transformer_fault":0.3454,"busbar_fault":0.2628},"confidence":0.3454,"correct":false},"nexus":{"pred":"busbar_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.0781,"breaker_fault":0.2541,"transformer_fault":0.1076,"busbar_fault":0.5602},"confidence":0.5602,"correct":false}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-Modality)","contrib":{"D":{"share":0.2323,"signed":0.1079},"T":{"share":0.0947,"signed":0.044},"R":{"share":0.673,"signed":0.3125}},"dominant":"R","telem